*105–120**（职测+综应合计），100 分制约 **60–70**\\n- **与目标的差距**：需从 ~112 提到 160，**约 +48 分**，属于大幅度提升，必须靠\\\"诊断→补短板\\\"而非重新打基础\\n- **关键未知项**：两科各自分数、职测各模块正确率 → 待摸底诊断卷补齐\"}"}}, {"type": "usage", "usage": {"inputTokens": 6, "outputTokens": 1703, "totalTokens": 108757, "cacheReadTokens": 105697, "cacheWriteTokens": 1351}}, {"type": "finish", "reason": {"kind": "tool-calls"}, "replayState": {"response": {"kind": "pi-ai", "version": 2, "api": "anthropic-messages", "provider": "ali-qwen", "model": "qwen3.8-max", "responseId": "msg_94d3228b-c2ca-4c7f-889c-4badd126d7a6", "stopReason": "toolUse"}, "blocks": [{"type": "reasoning", "thinkingSignature": ""}, {"type": "text"}, {"type": "tool-call"}, {"type": "tool-call"}]}}]}